 "notes": "Shieh et al. synthesized this phase from natural orthopyroxene (Mg1.80Fe0.18Al0.01Ca0.01)Si2O6, normalized here per SiO3. The source establishes Cmcm and Z=4 but does not publish a composition-specific refined coordinate model. Therefore the stored positions are a pure-MgSiO3 topology proxy, and the lattice is a proxy scaled to 164.9 A^3 rather than a recovered ambient structure. The preferred BM2 and the K0'=4.4 BM3 sensitivity fit share the same Figure 2 observations.",
